    <releases>
        <release version="1.1.7" date="2026-10-08">
            <description>
                <ul>
                    <li>The note editor's menu, page list, colour picker and selection options now match the tarus design</li>
                    <li>Zoom and lock buttons on the page, the save button and the read-only notice are easier to read</li>
                    <li>Settings shows distinct icons for phone and tablet layouts; the Logs and Report a bug screens follow your theme</li>
                </ul>
            </description>
        </release>
        <release version="1.1.6" date="2026-10-08">
            <description>
                <ul>
                    <li>Notes on your phone and on the web are now in one list</li>
                    <li>No encryption password needed any more; notes are stored encrypted on the server</li>
                    <li>If the server is temporarily unavailable, Settings › Sync shows a notice and syncing retries on its own</li>
                </ul>
            </description>
        </release>
        <release version="1.1.5" date="2026-10-07">
            <description>
                <ul>
                    <li>New look in the tarus design language: Inter font, one icon family, new cards, dialogs and settings; the accent colour comes from your theme</li>
                    <li>Floating bottom bar with a + button for new notes; the first tab is now called Overview</li>
                    <li>Paper lines keep the same colours as exported pages, whatever the theme</li>
                    <li>In-app About page with release notes; the app is now in Turkish and English</li>
                </ul>
            </description>
        </release>
        <release version="1.1.4" date="2026-10-06">
            <description>
                <ul>
                    <li>New launcher icon: the tarus Not mark (white notebook page on #AC865A) replaces Saber's yellow “S”, with a monochrome layer for themed icons</li>
                </ul>
            </description>
        </release>
        <release version="1.1.3" date="2026-10-06">
            <description>
                <ul>
                    <li>Privacy policy and account deletion now point to tarus (in-app deletion steps and a web request page), not to Saber or Nextcloud</li>
                    <li>Sync User-Agent is tarusNot/&lt;version&gt;; store texts describe tarus Not</li>
                    <li>Translation fixes (de, fr, es, it, ru, ar and others); the Saber copyright notice was restored in 10 languages</li>
                    <li>Play preparation: target API 36, versionCode above all earlier codes, app bundle build script</li>
                </ul>
            </description>
        </release>
        <release version="1.1.2" date="2026-10-05">
            <description>
                <ul>
                    <li>Visible Saber names in the app (settings, login, sync help, about) now say tarus Not; the GPL-3.0 and Saber attribution in About stays</li>
                    <li>The Saber sponsor and storage button was removed from About</li>
                </ul>
            </description>
        </release>
        <release version="1.1.1" date="2026-10-04">
            <description>
                <ul>
                    <li>Default theme is Modern when nothing is saved (same 8 themes as the tarus web apps, no System option)</li>
                    <li>Press and hold on an empty spot (home, browse, settings, login) to open Hata bildir, as in the other tarus mobile apps</li>
                </ul>
            </description>
        </release>
        <release version="1.1.0" date="2026-10-03">
            <description>
                <ul>
                    <li>tarus themes: the 8 canonical tarus themes (Settings → Theme), System follows device light/dark</li>
                    <li>Report a bug (Settings → Hata bildir): sent with the Pusula sync token via not.tarus.tr to Pusula and sistem.tarus.tr</li>
                </ul>
            </description>
        </release>
        <release version="1.0.0" date="2026-10-02">
            <description>
                <ul>
                    <li>First tarus Not release (based on Saber 1.36.1): sign in with a Pusula sync token, default server not.tarus.tr</li>
                    <li>Saber update check and Sentry crash reporting removed; release builds require the tarus signing key</li>
